     A** EDI R22 - Payments file

     A******************************************************************
     A* MODIFICATIONS:                                                 *
     A*                                                                *
     A* 07/06/09  C:180 SUPPORT 68701 - Add check number field.
     A*
     A* 10/19/07  C:53  Project: WC1584                                *
     A*                 Created.                                       *
     A*                                                                *
     A*****************************************************************
     A          R PP001                     TEXT('EDI R22 - PAYMENTS')
     A            P0CO#          3P 0       COLHDG('Company#')
     A            P0FND          3P 0       COLHDG('Fund')
     A            P0FYR          3P 0       COLHDG('Policy Year')
     A            P0CASE         7P 0       COLHDG('Case')
     A            P0PRCD         3A         COLHDG('Payment Reason Code')
     A            P0PAYE        40A         COLHDG('Payee')
     A            P0AMT          9P 2       COLHDG('Payment amount')
     A            P0STDT         7P 0       COLHDG('Payment Covers' +
     A                                      'Period Start Date')
     A            P0ENDT         7P 0       COLHDG('Payment Covers' +
     A                                      'Period Through Date')
     A            P0ISDT         7P 0       COLHDG('Payment Issue'  +
     A                                      'Date')
     A            P0FILL         7P 0       COLHDG('Filler -' +
     A                                      'Future Defined Usage')
     A            P0USER        10A         COLHDG('User')
     A            P0PGM         10A         COLHDG('Program')
     A            P0DT           7P 0       COLHDG('Date')
     A            P0TIME         6P 0       COLHDG('Time')
     A            P0SEQ#         5P 0       COLHDG('Log seq#')
     A******* BEG ADD ***** 07/06/09 *********************************
     A            P0CHK#         7S 0       COLHDG('Check#')
     A******* END ADD ***** 07/06/09 *********************************
